  "prefLabel": "Rev 413.03 Net Asset Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 413.03 Net Asset Requirements. The municipality shall adopt a maximum amount of net assets for purposes of the property tax exemptions provided in Rev 409, Rev 411, and Rev 412.02.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 412.03); ss by #13943-B, eff 4-27-24",
